{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01600","headline":"琴曲歌辞 山人劝酒 · 李白","name":"琴曲歌辞 山人劝酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍苍云松，落落绮皓。\n春风尔来爲阿谁，胡蝶忽然满芳草。\n秀眉霜雪颜桃花，骨青髓绿长美好。\n称是秦时避世人，劝酒相欢不知老。\n各守兔鹿志，耻随龙虎争。\n歘起佐太子，汉王乃复惊。\n顾谓戚夫人，彼翁羽翼成。\n归来南山下，泛若云无情。\n举觞酹巢由，洗耳何独清？\n浩歌望嵩岳，意气还相倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}